# StoryBox's stories and acts: ACTS (HOME) puts the acts on the white keys F G A B and the stories from middle C up;
# a tap moves on the next phrase, a hold fades over Fade; each act keeps its own settings; SAVE held resets one
wait 500
expect piece 0
expect view 0
tap HOME
expect view 0
# a tap on G3 (act 2, Warm Up): it waits for the next phrase, then glides over one
tapkey 2
wait 100
expect piece 0
wait 13000
expect piece 1
expect par3 62
shot warmup.png
# the bells' level on this act (the Bells page), kept with it
tap GLO
turn SELECT -4
expect view 6
spin K1 -5
expect par1 50
# a hold on B3 (act 4, Lights Down): it fades over Fade, starting now
key 6 down
wait 600
key 6 up
wait 3000
expect piece 1
wait 120000
expect piece 3
expect par3 40
# back to Warm Up: as it was left
tapkey 2
wait 15000
expect piece 1
expect par1 50
# SAVE held: Warm Up's recipe again
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
expect par1 55
# the stories: the white key E4 is the third story (Lighthouse), from its first act
tapkey 11
wait 15000
expect piece 8
expect par18 66
shot lighthouse.png
# PRESETS: the next story (Market Day)
turn PRESET 1
wait 15000
expect piece 12
# EDIT: LEAD, its page; again: back to the acts, and Home
tap EDIT
expect view 9
tap EDIT
expect view 0
expect piece 12
# saved, and still there after a restart
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 300
expect piece 12
